      "writtenOn": "2023-08-21T16:19:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You could wrap the line in `clang-format` tags as you did in `EC_STATUS_TEXT` above. That should keep `checkpath` happy and avoid clang-format issues.\n```suggestion\n/* clang-format off */\n#define TEXT_MAP_ITEMk, v)[k] \u003d #v\n/* clang-format on */\n```",
      "parentUuid": "ac86d900_4dfaa0ba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 770,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 770,
