      "writtenOn": "2023-11-02T20:31:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, but there should be a space. checkpatch is enforcing an invalid syntax rule, since it thinks we are accessing an index of `TEXT_MAP_ITEM(k, v)` array.",
      "parentUuid": "f58b187f_7e59cd08",
      "range": {
