        "id": 1529242
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-08-21T16:19:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does it work with this `undef` in place? I would expect the expansion to fail because by the time you get to someone doing something like `static const char *const ec_status_text[] \u003d EC_STATUS_TEXT;`, `EC_STATUS_TEXT` won\u0027t have a valid definition of `TEXT_MAP_ITEM`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 773,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 773,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "8b92d371a4b66773c27dfe8e8fab52ab927aeb92",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4ecf76ee_421af5c0",
        "filename": "include/ec_commands.h",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 773,
